Go (module: github.com/park-jun-woo/silk)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
silk reads GEUL pack archives through github.com/geul-org/gogeul (CC0 1.0,
GEUL project). Its pkg/pack compiles in github.com/klauspost/compress, so every
silk program that opens an archive includes it.

